      "content": "i know therapy is an option but i feel like i’ve tried everything. it’s just this constant, heavy weight. sometimes i sit there in the quiet and i just think... what if the only way to actually get that peace is to just not be here anymore? like, if the grayness is part of being alive, then wouldn't the only way to stop it be to just... end the cycle?",
